     "Table 8-1: Field Pro 0 / meter about 0 = Brushes and Slip Rings Test; Field Pro 0 / meter about 300 = Sensing Circuits Test; about 40-90 / 40-90 = AC Excitation Winding Test; about 80-160 / 200-300 = Sensing Circuits Test; about 240 / 240 = Voltage and Frequency Under Load Test. (p.67)",
     "Sensing Circuits Test A: run MANUAL - Field Pro AN and BN should each read 120 VAC +/-5% (stop if so). Otherwise pull the 7.5A fuse, unplug J5 and read 11S to 44S: in spec = check J5 pins, then replace the controller; OL = Procedure B. (p.68)",
     "Sensing Procedure B: unplug STR, read 11S-44S on the stator side: in spec = replace harness; OL = at the stator terminal block read 11-44: under 1 ohm = replace harness; OL or out of spec (0.00-1.0 ohm) = replace stator. (pp.68-69, p.18)",
