     "AC Excitation Winding Test: J7 breakout female end on the unit harness only (do NOT connect it to the controller); read test points 2-6 (spec 0.8-1.5 ohms): in spec = back to Preliminary Output Voltage Test; open = unplug STR and read Wire 2-6 on the stator side: in spec = replace harness, open = read studs 2-6 at the stator terminal block (open = replace stator); Wire 2 and Wire 6 STR-to-block must be under 5 ohms, then AVR PWM Output Test. (pp.61-62, p.18)",
     "Brushes/Rotor/Stator and AVR PWM checks: see AC Output Voltage Test path - AVR PWM about 1500-2000 Hz on Wire 4 to 0A, rotor 4-15 ohms, stator per Table 3-3. (pp.63-64, p.67, pp.69-70, p.18)",
     "Voltage and Frequency Under Load Test: at rated load expect 60 Hz and about 240 VAC; RPM recovers near 3600 but volts drop = AVR PWM Output Test; RPM cannot recover = Engine Cranks But Does Not Run test. (p.71)"
