     "Reconnect the ECM; Wire 606 on the mixer side of the ETMC to battery negative with the ECM on should be 0.5-4.5 VDC (correct = replace the ECM). 5 V = unplug the MPS and re-read - drops = replace mixer assembly. 0 V = move the lead to battery positive; if voltage shows, unplug the MPS - drops = replace mixer assembly. (p.107)"
