     "Still running: ground Wire 23 at the transfer-switch side of the WAGO block (no transfer = repair Wire 23 to the transfer switch); jumper the generator-side terminal to ground (no transfer = replace the WAGO block). (p.120)",
     "Generator off, battery off, utility off, unplug J4: continuity of Wire 23 from J4 to the WAGO block - none = replace harness; continuity = replace the controller. (p.120)"
