   "oilCapacity": "Approx. 1.9 qt (1.8 L) including filter Confirmed approx. 1.9 qt (1.8 L) incl. filter for the 20 kW Synergy (Generac 0K9138 Rev B (dealer manual), p.12 - the VSCF dealer manual predates this Y20 printing; same GT-999 engine). CONFLICT for the 999 cc: the V-twin engine service manual prints GTH 990/1000 2.3 qt (2.2 L) with filter change and 2.0 qt (1.9 L) without (Generac 0F6923 Rev E (dealer manual), p.87) - a generic engine figure; the generator manuals say approx. 1.9 qt, so fill to the dipstick.",
